 "description": "キプロス島のヴァローシャ地区が50年間ゴーストタウンとなっている理由を解説。1974年のクーデターとトルコ軍侵攻により分断された島の複雑な歴史、ギリシャ系とトルコ系住民の対立、そして米ソ冷戦の影響まで、地中海の要衝を巡る地政学的な悲劇を詳しく紹介します。\n\n0:00 intro\n0:53 地中海の宝石\n5:39 地中海のキューバ\n15:24 50年間の封印\n\n参考記事\nhttps://www.youtube.com/watch?v=KwVGZ-DT8TY\n\n266. Telegram From the Embassy in Cyprus to the Department of State\nhttps://history.state.gov/historicaldocuments/frus1961-63v16/d266\n\nA GEOPOLITICS OF CYPRUS\nhttps://www.proquest.com/docview/920317889?sourcetype=Scholarly%20Journals\n\nThe Strange Case of Varosha in Cyprus\nhttps://www.iwm.at/publication/iwmpost-article/the-strange-case-of-varosha-in-cyprus\n\nAnalyzing and Resolving the Cyprus Conflict \nhttps://dergipark.org.tr/tr/download/article-file/1101466\n\nCyprus in the Commonwealth: pre-membership perceptions by Greek Cypriot elites, 1959-1961\nhttps://www.tandfonline.com/doi/full/10.1080/00358533.2022.2033023\n\nTHE CARVE-UP OF CYPRUS\nhttps://www.marxists.org/history/erol/uk.firstwave/mlob-cyprus.pdf\n\nThe Soviet Union and Cyprus in 1974 Events\nhttps://www.athensjournals.gr/history/2016-2-4-3-Aslim.pdf\n\nMoscow’s Strategic Obsession with the Eastern\nMediterranean:\nLessons from pre-Cold-War history\nhttps://www.eliamep.gr/wp-content/uploads/2022/06/Policy-paper-103-final.pdf\n\nKissinger in Cyprus\nhttps://jacobin.com/2023/11/kissinger-in-cyprus\n\n\n▼使用素材\n■映像素材・画像素材\npixabay\nhttps://pixabay.com/ja/videos/\npexels\nhttps://www.pexels.com/ja-jp/videos/\nACイラスト\nhttps://www.ac-illust.com/\nFreepik\nhttps://jp.freepik.com/\nSILHOUETTE DESIGN\nhttps://kage-design.com/\n\n■音源素材\nartlist\nhttps://artlist.io/\nhttps://pocketse.booth.pm/items/3767621\n効果音ラボ\nhttps://soundeffect-lab.info/\n\n【楽曲提供：株式会社ウナシ】\n\n\n#ゆっくり解説 #地理 #地政学",
